From 4afddf1b35b3269765bbff7ce1efda2cf399eca3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: InvoiceFlow Fix <fix@invoiceflow.dev>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 07:27:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: resolve all critical bugs and polish for deployment
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Backend:
- Fix login to return full Token schema (refresh_token, expires_in)
- Add create_refresh_token import and settings import
- Replace models.Customer with models.Client throughout (ORM model fix)
- Fix invoice/recurring ORM writes: customer_id -> client_id
- Auto-generate invoice_number server-side in create_invoice
- Create line items inside create_invoice transaction
- Fix PDF to use tempfile instead of local filesystem path
- Improve PDF layout: shows client name, line items table, totals
- Add auth guard (get_current_user) to all list/GET endpoints
- Add POST /api/v1/ai/weekly-summary backend endpoint (OpenAI or Anthropic)

Frontend:
- Add auth.register() to api.ts (was missing — register button was broken)
- Fix invoice create to send client_id instead of customer_id
- Fix invoice list to match customer by client_id field
- Fix dashboard AI summary to call backend instead of Anthropic directly
- Rewrite analytics page to use live API data (was 100% hardcoded mock data)

Docs:
- Write complete README with setup, env vars, Docker instructions, feature table
